  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/art-ix/picturesharp.jxl",
  "published": "2026-10-27T22:19:11.307Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.7.7: faster lossless (Modular) encoding: the weighted predictor runs once per pixel (its errors from the tree-learning scan are reused for tokenization), the MA tree is resolved per channel and walked a row at a time, property quantization by counting, reused split-search buffers, ANS division by exact reciprocals, faster bit writing and forward RCT. 12 MP lossless e7 encode about 1.8x faster than 0.7.2, 1 MP about 1.7x. Output is byte-identical to 0.7.2.",
